      "side": 1,
      "message": "In a worktree (not the base), `.git` is a file not a directory. See https://crrev.com/c/7739623 where I added support for worktrees .git files previously.\n\nYou might want something more like this:\n\n```suggestion\n            for root, dirs, _ in os.walk(args.new_workdir):\n                has_git \u003d os.path.exists(os.path.join(root, \u0027.git\u0027))\n                if \u0027.git\u0027 in dirs:\n                    dirs.remove(\u0027.git\u0027)\n                if has_git and root not in processed_workdirs:\n                    cleanup_cow_checkout(root)\n```",
